{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/f5ee2f71a2968a9ce859332b93dd938b.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/8483824006f8ea06d12af480d892f465.poster.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=323 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/8483824006f8ea06d12af480d892f465.webm?t=1771843874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense one-on-one poker battles against gruesome demonic monsters, each with unique abilities. The strength of your poker hand determines your damage, and the sum of your cards\u2019 values is your defense..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/799f113fec2140d4d5772b57a5bab5a5.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/fc0ffa373fd361435d140d80e8a32726.poster.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/fc0ffa373fd361435d140d80e8a32726.webm?t=1771843874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and master an ever-expanding arsenal of cheat tricks as you shape your run around a constantly evolving deck. Conceal and swap cards mid-battle, boost key values to force powerful hands, sabotage the enemy\u2019s draw, and bend the odds toward carefully crafted synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s a devilish twist: you and your opponent draw from the same deck. Every card you add, remove, duplicate, or modify affects both sides of the table. To survive, you must deliberately build and refine a deck that amplifies your current cheats and relics while minimizing the enemy\u2019s advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trick raises your foe\u2019s suspicion meter. Push your cheating too far, and they\u2019ll lash out with devastating fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/ad0b2c6561833e55a460851e471ce379.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/de5e5d18fc90d522e501e27da7188328.poster.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/de5e5d18fc90d522e501e27da7188328.webm?t=1771843874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means starting over, but not empty-handed. Earn permanent upgrades, new cheat cards, powerful relics, and fresh strategies with each run. Adapt your deck and cheat arsenal to tackle deeper levels of Hell and inch closer to ultimate redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/c19c8089b6a8da8e78187ba4ed833741.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img