, remove, duplicate, or modify affects both sides of the table. To survive, you must deliberately build and refine a deck that amplifies your current cheats and relics while minimizing the enemy\u2019s advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trick raises your foe\u2019s suspicion meter. Push your cheating too far, and they\u2019ll lash out with devastating fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/ad0b2c6561833e55a460851e471ce379.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/de5e5d18fc90d522e501e27da7188328.poster.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/de5e5d18fc90d522e501e27da7188328.webm?t=1771843874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means starting over, but not empty-handed. Earn permanent upgrades, new cheat cards, powerful relics, and fresh strategies with each run. Adapt your deck and cheat arsenal to tackle deeper levels of Hell and inch closer to ultimate redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/c19c8089b6a8da8e78187ba4ed833741.avif?t=1771843874\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699850/extras/5d8d3f747d4453a9b882f927e75f8f11.poster.avif?